<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ GOVT JUL 2009 BONDS YIELD 6.829 PCT AT TENDER.</title>
<headline>NZ GOVT JUL 2009 BONDS YIELD 6.829 PCT AT TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday its offer of NZ$150 million of July 2009 bonds yielded an average 6.829 percent at tender.</p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$228 million.</p>
<p>The bonds have an seven percent coupon, and the settlement date is August 12.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
</text>
